      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Жена́ гото́вила, а её му́ж по́стоянно ворча́л рядом с ней: «Сни́зь ско́рость!",
      "text_en": "The wife was cooking, and her husband kept nagging her from beside her: “Slow down!",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhená\" data-defn=\"жена\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Жена́</span><rt>Zhená</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gotóvila\" data-defn=\"готовила\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">гото́вила</span><rt>gotóvila</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"a\" data-defn=\"а\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">а</span><rt>a</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"eyo\" data-defn=\"её\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">её</span><rt>eyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"múzh\" data-defn=\"муж\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">му́ж</span><rt>múzh</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"póstoyanno\" data-defn=\"постоянно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">по́стоянно</span><rt>póstoyanno</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vorchál\" data-defn=\"ворчал\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ворча́л</span><rt>vorchál</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ryadom\" data-defn=\"рядом\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">рядом</span><rt>ryadom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ney\" data-defn=\"ней\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ней</span><rt>ney</rt></ruby>: «<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Sníz&#x27;\" data-defn=\"снизь\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Сни́зь</span><rt>Sníz&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"skórost&#x27;\" data-defn=\"скорость\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ско́рость</span><rt>skórost&#x27;</rt></ruby>!",
      "transliteration": "Zhená gotóvila, a eyo múzh póstoyanno vorchál ryadom s ney: «Sníz' skórost'!",
