      "chunk_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Я зна́ю, как гото́вить.",
      "text_en": "I know how to cook.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Я</span><rt>Ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"znáyu\" data-defn=\"знаю\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зна́ю</span><rt>znáyu</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kak\" data-defn=\"как\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">как</span><rt>kak</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gotóvit&#x27;\" data-defn=\"готовить\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">гото́вить</span><rt>gotóvit&#x27;</rt></ruby>.",
